<title>UK: SBNSW sets A$100 million bond due December 2002.</title>
<headline>SBNSW sets A$100 million bond due December 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion</p>
<p> BORROWER   STATE BANK OF NEW SOUTH WALES</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  GOVERNMENT OF STATE OF NEW SOUTH WALES</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     6.5	 MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.24    PAY DATE   S30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LONDON    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.5	 SELL CONC  1.5	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
